MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe35610c1c494fbcb959bc09baacea3d, type: 3}
  m_Name: TenderExcuse
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Kindrith.Dialogue::Kindrith.Dialogue.DialogueTree
  Archetype: 1
  EntryNodeId: node_0
  Nodes:
  - Id: node_0
    DemonLine: Hey. It was a long day. You don't have to be a machine every hour.
    Options:
    - Text: Being kind to myself doesn't have to mean doing this specific thing.
      Class: 0
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1a
    - Text: Yeah, it was a lot.
      Class: 1
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1b
    - Text: I don't have to be a machine.
      Class: 2
      LeadsToNodeId: node_1c
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_1a
    DemonLine: Of course not. But what would a kind person do right now? Rest. Unwind.
      Maybe just... take the edge off.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_1b
    DemonLine: I know. I'm not saying it wasn't. I'm saying you noticed, and that's
      something. Let's take care of you.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_1c
    DemonLine: You don't. Nobody is watching but you. Be gentle with the person who
      made it through today.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: node_2
  - Id: node_2
    DemonLine: You can be gentle with yourself and still do the thing. The two aren't
      opposites. Please. Just for tonight.
    Options:
    - Text: Gentleness that hurts me tomorrow isn't gentleness. I know the difference
        now.
      Class: 0
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3a
    - Text: I want to feel better.
      Class: 1
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3b
    - Text: Just tonight. You're right.
      Class: 2
      LeadsToNodeId: node_3c
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3a
    DemonLine: ...okay. You've been listening to someone else lately.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3b
    DemonLine: Of course you do. There are other ways.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
  - Id: node_3c
    DemonLine: Good. I'm glad we talked.
    Options: []
    NextNodeId: 
